# Windows batch launchers MUST arrive with CRLF: cmd.exe fails line-by-line on LF files
# and the daemon never starts, with an empty log as the only symptom (docs/GOTCHAS.md #5).
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# PowerShell 5.1 is happier with CRLF too, and the watchdog is edited on Windows anyway.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
# Patch files must survive byte-for-byte or `git apply` rejects them on a Windows clone.
*.patch -text
*.diff -text
# Everything else: normalise to LF in the repo.
* text=auto
